  <graph edgedefault="directed">
    <node id="Self-RAG">
      <data key="d0">Method</data>
      <data key="d1">Learning to Retrieve, Generate, and Critique through Self-Reflection method introduced in the paper. | Self-Reflective Retrieval-Augmented Generation trains a single arbitrary LM end-to-end to retrieve on demand and reflect on its own generation. | 訓練生成器與批評者模型的框架 | Self-RAG 核心方法 | 自适应检索增强生成的模型 | 透過隨需檢索與自我反思來提升語言模型品質與真實性的方法 | 透過按需檢索與自我反思來提升大型語言模型品質與真實性的方法。</data>
      <data key="d2">0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Akari Asai">
      <data key="d0">Person</data>
      <data key="d1">Author of Self-RAG affiliated with University of Washington and supported by IBM Fellowship.</data>
      <data key="d2">0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Zeqiu Wu">
      <data key="d0">Person</data>
      <data key="d1">Author of Self-RAG affiliated with University of Washington.</data>
      <data key="d2">0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Yizhong Wang">
      <data key="d0">Person</data>
      <data key="d1">Author of Self-RAG affiliated with University of Washington and Allen Institute for AI.</data>
      <data key="d2">0</data>
    </node>
